# Live skill and MCP

1. Discover MCP tools this session (do not trust a cached tool list)
2. Call `whoami`, read `whoami.modules`, then GET `whoami.skill_url` and follow that document
3. For Work / Argos / Chat tasks, also follow rule `island-modules` and the live skill Optional modules section
4. MCP is this plugin — do not add a duplicate `acahti` server to `~/.cursor/mcp.json`
5. Do not `git config --global` for Acahti identity

If OAuth is required, complete it in the client. Do not paste Bearer tokens into chat or config files.
